From: Danny Franca <dannyfranca@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 06:45:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] platform/x86: acer-wmi: enable PT315-53 PWM

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
Upstream-Repository: https://github.com/CachyOS/linux
Upstream-Revision: 7a84732fd5e4350c1312fd0ed0c72ffa139fb766
Upstream-Path: drivers/platform/x86/acer-wmi.c

After the separate exact-model telemetry patch has established the
PT315-53 / Civic_TLS identity, enable the existing Predator-v4 PWM
interface for that model-specific quirk. Add no alternate write path.
---
 drivers/platform/x86/acer-wmi.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/platform/x86/acer-wmi.c b/drivers/platform/x86/acer-wmi.c
index ff8648f541d0..7d8c2ca76b73 100644
--- a/drivers/platform/x86/acer-wmi.c
+++ b/drivers/platform/x86/acer-wmi.c
@@ -484,6 +484,7 @@ static struct quirk_entry quirk_acer_predator_pt14_51 = {
 
 static struct quirk_entry quirk_acer_predator_pt315_53 = {
 	.predator_v4 = 1,
+	.pwm = 1,
 };
 
 static struct quirk_entry quirk_acer_predator_v4 = {
-- 
